      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PLEASE NOTE: ENQUIRIES VIA EMAIL ONLY\r\n\r\n4 Semi Detached House situated in a private and peaceful location and yet only a short distance from the Town Centre & all it's amenities. The house which has recently been refurbished is only a short stroll from Kerry General Hospital, Kerry co. Council Buildings & The Manor Village Shopping Centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tFurnished Semi-Detached House\r\n\tFibre Broadband available nearby\r\n\tLetting Term: Flexible\r\n\tEmail Applications only\r\n\tConveniently located to many amenities in the area incl. Manor Village, Kerry General Hospital and an array of Pubs, Restaurants, Shops in the Tralee areas.\r\n\tLarge Garden at Rear"
      },
